Package: mint-project-bar
Version: 0.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: djshades2004 <djshades2004@gmail.com>
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0
Recommends: python3-psutil, python3-xdg, gir1.2-gtklayershell-0.1, libgtk-layer-shell0, gir1.2-wnck-3.0
Description: Left-edge dock for Linux Mint (Cinnamon-first)
 Pin folders and apps to a glassy blue sidebar on any monitor,
 see and switch between open windows grouped by app.
 Runs on X11 out of the box; layer-shell + Wnck unlock anchoring
 and the window switcher.
